{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a puzzle-like inventory manager survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/eb8e2638a918308b39d4bf721bef2b08.poster.avif?t=1767593351\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/eb8e2638a918308b39d4bf721bef2b08.webm?t=1767593351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/eb8e2638a918308b39d4bf721bef2b08.mp4?t=1767593351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move, rotate, </strong>or<strong> stack</strong> different items to keep your inventory organized and free up space for more supplies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair</strong> your weapons before they break and <strong>reload</strong> them so you don't run out of ammo in the middle of a battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/ac742a3a3d6e3837fd88f06308c64a12.poster.avif?t=1767593351\" width=780 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/ac742a3a3d6e3837fd88f06308c64a12.webm?t=1767593351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/ac742a3a3d6e3837fd88f06308c64a12.mp4?t=1767593351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recharge </strong>the batteries of the light or you will battle in dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>refill</strong> the generator so you can use the electric trap to kill enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/47ecedd99791705c6fe903744205e8f0.poster.avif?t=1767593351\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/47ecedd99791705c6fe903744205e8f0.webm?t=1767593351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/47ecedd99791705c6fe903744205e8f0.mp4?t=1767593351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day you lose food and water points, so you need to keep an eye on you hungry, thirsty and injuries meters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eat, drink and cure to be alive as long as you can.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/2e44b65ffb3db21d00b5777e9aa777c5.poster.avif?t=1767593351\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/2e44b65ffb3db21d00b5777e9aa777c5.webm?t=1767593351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883110/extras/2e44b65ffb3db21d00b5777e9aa777c5.mp4?t=1767593351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>manage your &quot;shelter&quot; inventory</strong> and try to be &quot;preper&quot; for <strong>auto-battle enemies</strong> that try to enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared